# board.pdl - the 40-tile ring (RING-BOARD-AS-RMMV-EVENTS-DESIGN.md section 3). House theme (stores, banks, castles); no cards in v0, so the six classic card tiles are plain properties.
# TILE | n | kind | name | price | rent | group     kind = go | prop | tax | jail | gotojail | parking.  Rent is FIXED (price / 8, no houses, no color-set bonus in v0).
# A tax tile's amount is rules.pdl `tax_<group>`; `group` is unused by the v0 rules (kept for the v1 color-set rule).
# Read by ops/tile_lookup.c. Positions are 0..39; GO is 0, Jail is 10, Go To Jail is 30.
